#=========================================================================================
# FEOL 01 - Wells
#
# DNW is mapped from the Calibre source layer (7/1), but its source checks use
# ABUT<90/SINGULAR, directional enclosure, voltage and net-class semantics not
# represented by this module API; keep them disabled rather than approximating.
# NW1 source checks likewise depend on voltage/net classes and ABUT<90 /
# SINGULAR REGION semantics not represented by the current module API.
#=========================================================================================

if FEOL
  # Unsupported source rules: DNW_W_1, DNW_S_1, DNW_S_2a, DNW_S_3,
  # DNW_S_4, DNW_S_5, DNW_EN_1, DNW_EN_2, DNW_O_1, DNW_R_1,
  # DNW_R_3; NW1_W_1, NW1_S_1 through NW1_S_5, NW1_A_1.
  # TGOX/DGOX checks also require source-specific layers/qualifiers.
end

